    "name": "Tomahawk: Diesel Ants",
    "steam_appid": 3759790,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759790/extras/94a787d97e68122e06145a2d1a140af8.poster.avif?t=1751878931\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759790/extras/94a787d97e68122e06145a2d1a140af8.webm?t=1751878931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759790/extras/94a787d97e68122e06145a2d1a140af8.mp4?t=1751878931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Everyone around has gone crazy!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759790/extras/e7ce8ec9d620a9d4b2e681f7a3e3457f.avif?t=1751878931\" width=800 height=422 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It was the year 2092. Shade found himself in a not very pleasant situation... After all, this was the peak of a man-made disaster. As if possessed by the Devil himself, the android ants came to life and created a real Hell. The plant turned into an anthill that grows with every moment. Metal, blood, ruins... This must be put to an end.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Tomahawk rifle will help you</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759790/extras/b87447cfe069da9bffe5103cf2e5d287.avif?t=1751878931\" data-has-big width=800 height=422 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the help of this weapon, you can do more than just shoot. It is equipped with an axe that can be used to chop down enemies, throw them over a distance, and even control them in flight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759790/extras/209c3a01b2130e4d0fc5e46cb2337d11.poster.avif?t=1751878931\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759790/extras/209c3a01b2130e4d0fc5e46cb2337d11.webm?t=1751878931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759790/extras/209c3a01b2130e4d0fc5e46cb2337d11.mp4?t=1751878931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The ants are right there!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759790/extras/3729e86e33535b0482b827a9f4e91e7f.avif?t=1751878931\" data-has-big width=800 height=422 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They constantly run after the hero, attacking with a chainsaw. If they can't catch up, they use saws. They can dodge shots and jump to any heights, and also hide in pipes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759790/extras/c4fac072f8baf4b18d15e02c03dc95a5.poster.avif?t=1751878931\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759790/extras/c4fac072f8baf4b18d15e02c03dc95a5.webm?t=1751878931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759790/extras/c4fac072f8baf4b18d15e02c03dc95a5.mp4?t=1751878931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The crazy Buggy racer is heading towards...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759790/extras/8677c5aaeb00bafc1eed4db918aa0241.avif?t=1751878931\" data-has-big width=800 height=422 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ant on a one-wheeled impenetrable bike. It can shoot from a turret and ram. Its weak point is the red gas cylinders on the sides.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759790/extras/7073a3060b9982918b4131a939926c36.poster.avif?t=1751878931\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759790/extras/7073a3060b9982918b4131a939926c36.webm?t=1751878931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759790/extras/7073a3060b9982918b4131a939926c36.mp4?t=1751878931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can activate traps with a Tomahawk strike. The press crushes enemies, and the pendulums knock them down with their blades.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Don't forget about supplies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759790/extras/4e34cc9d30c37856c3c8a5e766d102d4.avif?t=1751878931\" data-has-big width=800 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Health and ammo can be found by exploring locations. They also drop from killed enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >There is a trap everywhere...</h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759790/extras/94a787d97e68122e06145a2d1a140af8.poster.avif?t=1751878931\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759790/extras/94a787d97e68122e06145a2d1a140af8.webm?t=1751878931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759790/extras/94a787d97e68122e06145a2d1a140af8.mp4?t=1751878931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Everyone around has gone crazy!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759790/extras/e7ce8ec9d620a9d4b2e681f7a3e3457f.avif?t=1751878931\" width=800 height=422 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It was the year 2092. Shade found himself in a not very pleasant situation... After all, this was the peak of a man-made disaster. As if possessed by the Devil himself, the android ants came to life and created a real Hell. The plant turned into an anthill that grows with every moment. Metal, blood, ruins... This must be put to an end.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Tomahawk rifle will help you</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759790/extras/b87447cfe069da9bffe5103cf2e5d287.avif?t=1751878931\" data-has-big width=800 height=422 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the help of this weapon, you can do more than just shoot. It is equipped with an axe that can be used to chop down enemies, throw them over a distance, and even control them in flight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinli