ta-has-big width=800 height=422 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ant on a one-wheeled impenetrable bike. It can shoot from a turret and ram. Its weak point is the red gas cylinders on the sides.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759790/extras/7073a3060b9982918b4131a939926c36.poster.avif?t=1751878931\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759790/extras/7073a3060b9982918b4131a939926c36.webm?t=1751878931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759790/extras/7073a3060b9982918b4131a939926c36.mp4?t=1751878931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can activate traps with a Tomahawk strike. The press crushes enemies, and the pendulums knock them down with their blades.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Don't forget about supplies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759790/extras/4e34cc9d30c37856c3c8a5e766d102d4.avif?t=1751878931\" data-has-big width=800 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Health and ammo can be found by exploring locations. They also drop from killed enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >There is a trap everywhere...</h2>",
